    "title": "Deputies respond to fatal e-bike crash near Palo Verde, 44th - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago TUCSON, Ariz. (13 News) - The Pima County Sheriff’s Department responded to a fatal E-Bike crash at South Palo Verde Road and East 44th Street on Sunday, Sept. 20. The PCSD said at approximately 9:15 a.m., deputies arrived at the crash and learned that the driver, 33-year-old Maya Ortiz, had failed to stop at a stop sign and hit the bicyclist. Read full article\n2",
